  "notes": [
    "DRAFT: a skeleton from the world database export of map 189 (tools/dungeongen, spec tools/dungeongen/plans.json). The boss order is the usual clear order, the packs are the spawn clusters nearest each boss; walls, doors, stairs and events are unknown to it. Not mapped, not live-checked: do the GM-invisible mapping walk and correct the route before the first run (AUTO-IMPROVE step 0); dungeon_run refuses it without allow_draft.",
    "A wait_for on a door a lever or key opens needs timeout_s 60 (the default): a linked door can open 30 s after the use.",
    "Needs: chapel door (GO_CHAPPEL_DOOR) before Mograine and Whitemane",
    "Needs: Mograine and Whitemane are one event: Whitemane resurrects Mograine",
    "One of four wings of map 189.",
    "Census 2026-10-23 (96 spawns, 93 trash 34-40 rank 1, 3 bosses): all trash is humanoid faction 67 (Fairbanks is undead type 6, faction 67). Fleers: 4294 4298 4299 4300 4301 4302 (EventAI 47); 4295 4303 4540 do not flee. Healers: 4303 Abbot (Heal 6064 + Renew 8362), 4300 Wizard (Healing Wave 547 + Lightning Bolt 20802), 4299 Chaplain (Power Word: Shield 6066 + Renew 8362): kill_first 4303 4300 4299, and no cc_always, so no pack depends on a Polymorph (the r21 Library step 54 was a failed CC on 4299 in this same wing data). No creature_groups and no rare rank 2/4 in the wing. Six single-member patrollers carry their creature_movement path as a patrol block (period estimated); the Wizard 39967 (376 yd) and the Myrmidon 39965 (329 yd) loop the whole lower hall and cross most pulls.",
    "Fairbanks 4542 (boss_high_inquisitor_fairbanks: Curse of Blood, Dispel Magic, Fear, Sleep, PW:S, Heal at 25 %) stands 16 yd from the Monk 4540 of pull group 6, inside his 20 yd detection and behind the Secret Door 97700: the pull is gone and the Monk is boss.first. The door objects 104591, 104600 and 97700 all stand state 1 (active) in the spawn export; the instance script closes the High Inquisitor's Door 104600 when the event starts and opens it when Mograine dies, so no door step is exported.",
    "Mograine (3976) and Whitemane (3977) are one event: on Mograine's progress the instance calls every Scarlet Chaplain/Wizard/Centurion/Champion/Abbot/Monk within 82 yd to his victim, and on his death the High Inquisitor's Door opens and Whitemane walks to him; the plan kills Mograine in leg 1 and Whitemane in leg 2, all packs within 82 yd are pulled earlier, and the event itself is the run leader's fight, not a plan step."
  ],
